      "Language": "chi",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Asthma, often begins in childhood, can affect dental health. In return, dental treatment and dental anxiety can lead to an acute asthmatic attack. This article reviews the potential influence of asthma on dental treatment and dental medications and specifically describes the modes of dental conscious sedation in asthmatic patients."},
